WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.938
Ta-da!

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.406
Hi, it's N-ko.

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:10.543
Anime that Netflix employees like!

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:15.949
We Netflix employees are dedicated to delivering content every day.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:20.887
We feel deep affection for the titles we deliver.

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:25.592
I was curious about which shows my coworkers around the world liked,

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:28.695
especially considering their deep affection for the titles.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.798
So I had my close coworkers help me

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:34.200
by answering a survey.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.605
I asked about their favorite animation and their animation history.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:41.908
I received some interesting answers.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.878
I wanted to share their responses with you,

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:46.713
so that's why I planned this video.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:50.083
So, basically, these are the reactions from abroad.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.153
Okay, let's get started!

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:58.124
This is what was on the survey!

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:01.061
What was your first anime? What anime are you currently watching? Recommendations.
Recommendation for a Netflix original series. Most anticipated Netflix original series.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.762
Some of the answers

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:07.967
were written in great detail, showing their passion for that show.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:12.238
I could tell that they really loved that anime.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.740
One more thing.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:17.444
Not all the survey questions were answered by everybody,

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:21.915
so please understand that there will be differences in the contents of their answers.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:29.089
Now, the results for their very first anime are these!

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:33.026
Three of them answered PRETTY GUARDIAN SAILOR MOON.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:36.696
The others said DRAGON BALL and NEON GENESIS EVANGELION.

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:41.968
It seems many of their first anime are popular ones.

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:44.838
Looking at the titles of these anime,

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:50.176
they were made in the '80s through the 2000s.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:54.180
So I thought they were exposed to anime

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:57.450
before anime became a huge international sensation as well.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:02.188
PRETTY GUARDIAN SAILOR MOON is my absolute favorite too,

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:07.327
so if I get a chance, I'd like to discuss it with my coworkers!

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:12.565
By the way, my very first anime is PRETTY GUARDIAN SAILOR MOON too.

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:16.269
When my neighbor was moving back to Japan,

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:21.207
they gave me a PRETTY GUARDIAN SAILOR MOON VHS, and I watched it every day.

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:24.377
Next is anime they are currently watching.

00:02:24.878 --> 00:02:26.713
Here are their answers.

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:29.582
Three answered ATTACK ON TITAN.

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:32.118
It might be the timing when this survey was done,

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:36.222
but ATTACK ON TITAN, with its final season playing right now,

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:40.126
is being watched and loved all over the world.

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:44.230
The rest of the final season is something to look forward to.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:48.668
And the others with multiples votes, such as

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:52.038
JUJUTSU KAISEN, RE:ZERO, and MY HERO ACADEMIA,

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:54.941
are shows that are also popular in Japan.

00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:57.777
ONE PIECE and HAIKYU!! are mentioned.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:04.084
Animation from Jump comics has been and will continue to be loved globally.

00:03:04.084 --> 00:03:06.753
The fact is that BLOOD OF ZEUS, a Netflix original series,

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:10.623
which is not affected by seasonal series

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:15.795
such as spring and summer series, made it to the rankings as well.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:19.532
This showed that the era where anime could only be watched on TV is over,

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:25.238
and several different forms of animation are accepted now.

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:29.976
Next is anime recommended by Netflix employees.

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:33.513
Netflix employees who know many titles

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:36.683
are only allowed to make one recommendation.

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:43.456
With such heart-wrenching restrictions, which anime are they going to recommend?

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:45.959
I'm very curious about their answers too.

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:47.894
Here are their answers.

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:51.464
Keep in mind that I asked this to my coworkers all over the world.

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:57.470
I didn't expect some of the answers to be the same.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:03.476
COWBOY BEBOP and FULLMETAL ALCHEMIST are great anime,

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:08.548
but I'm surprised to see how they were so influential all over the world.

00:04:08.982 --> 00:04:12.485
Their reasons for recommendation vary.

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:18.391
Some recommended a show for a newbie anime watcher,

00:04:18.391 --> 00:04:22.662
and others recommended something because it's their favorite.

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:26.866
Some made the recommendation for the charm of the anime.

00:04:26.866 --> 00:04:30.837
All their answers are full of love for their recommendations.

00:04:30.837 --> 00:04:37.510
However, if GRAVE OF THE FIREFLIES was recommended to me

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.012
and I watched it,

00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:42.549
it might have been a tough experience.

00:04:42.549 --> 00:04:46.453
Its content is heavy, and depending on your state of mind,

00:04:46.453 --> 00:04:49.155
you might end up getting depressed.

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:51.224
It's not limited to anime,

00:04:51.224 --> 00:04:55.261
but making a recommendation is quite challenging.

00:04:56.029 --> 00:05:01.334
Next is recommended Netflix original series.

00:05:01.334 --> 00:05:06.840
I'm curious about what my coworkers like.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.742
Here are their answers.

00:05:08.742 --> 00:05:11.978
Three of them answered CASTLEVANIA.

00:05:12.445 --> 00:05:19.419
This was created based on Konami's game, Castlevania.

00:05:19.419 --> 00:05:23.590
The term "dark fantasy" is the perfect description for this show.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.960
The game's unique world outlook

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.363
is represented well in the animation.

00:05:30.363 --> 00:05:32.599
I think they've done an amazing job.

00:05:32.599 --> 00:05:35.669
Season four started recently,

00:05:35.669 --> 00:05:38.872
so it's a great opportunity to binge-watch the whole series.

00:05:38.872 --> 00:05:43.443
Also on the list are the very popular GREAT PRETENDER

00:05:43.443 --> 00:05:44.678
and BEASTARS.

00:05:44.678 --> 00:05:50.684
Another show mentioned is THE WAY OF THE HOUSEHUSBAND.
For this show, we had an online live event

00:05:50.684 --> 00:05:52.218
with Kenji Tsuda, the main voice actor.

00:05:52.218 --> 00:05:56.956
I am glad to see that most of the popular shows were covered.

00:05:56.956 --> 00:06:02.295
I related the most to the reason for recommending DEVILMAN CRYBABY,

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:06.933
and I think I'll say the same thing when I recommend the show to my friends.

00:06:06.933 --> 00:06:09.569
Please watch it if your interest is piqued.

00:06:10.036 --> 00:06:11.571
Last question on the survey is

00:06:11.571 --> 00:06:16.443
the most anticipated Netflix original series in animation.

00:06:16.443 --> 00:06:20.180
Several different shows are scheduled for this year,

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:24.751
but which show are they anticipating the most?

00:06:25.285 --> 00:06:28.054
I'm very interested in their answers too.

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:30.156
Let's take a look!

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:32.392
Three of them said THE WAY OF THE HOUSEHUSBAND.

00:06:32.926 --> 00:06:40.266
I wonder if the combination of a yakuza and househusband
is a globally intriguing and distinctive theme?

00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:44.437
It's a good-paced comedy, and the unique character

00:06:44.437 --> 00:06:47.440
enhanced by the skills of the voice actor

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:50.110
matches this show perfectly.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:52.879
It seems easy to follow, which

00:06:52.879 --> 00:06:56.049
makes you want to continue watching the show.

00:06:56.049 --> 00:06:59.319
This may be the reason why it is so anticipated.

00:06:59.319 --> 00:07:04.891
The answer I was interested in was TRESE.

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:07.994
It's set in Manila, the capital of the Philippines,

00:07:07.994 --> 00:07:13.933
and a female detective, Trese, protects the city from the evil powers.

00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:15.969
It's a horror fantasy show.

00:07:15.969 --> 00:07:20.006
I think it's a special show,

00:07:20.006 --> 00:07:23.843
where Filipino culture is embodied in the story.

00:07:23.843 --> 00:07:28.914
One day, shows won't be categorized as "first time in Japan" or "first time abroad"

00:07:28.914 --> 00:07:32.284
in the anime industry.

00:07:32.284 --> 00:07:35.921
I think this show represents that.

00:07:35.921 --> 00:07:43.529
There are other shows such as YASUKE and SPRIGGAN that are worth watching,

00:07:43.529 --> 00:07:47.633
so I'll continue to spread the news among my coworkers too.

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:52.738
What did you think of the recommendations made by Netflix employees?

00:07:52.738 --> 00:07:56.509
Now that we can watch anime anywhere in the world,

00:07:56.509 --> 00:07:59.478
I think it's wonderful that we can be absorbed in what we love

00:07:59.478 --> 00:08:04.120
at the same time, with the same passion.

00:08:04.433 --> 00:08:06.636
Anime joins the world!

00:08:07.403 --> 00:08:12.041
Is it too dramatic to say that?

00:08:12.041 --> 00:08:14.644
If any of the shows we shared today

00:08:14.644 --> 00:08:18.948
intrigued you in any way, please go ahead and check them out!

00:08:18.948 --> 00:08:24.220
I plan to watch CASTLEVANIA before going to bed tonight.

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:27.256
See you again!

